<title>SOUTH AFRICA: WR Cons operating loss deepens, to pay div.</title>
<headline>WR Cons operating loss deepens, to pay div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 12.0	  vs none</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   8.89	  vs 0.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   8.10	  vs 0.13</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.79	  vs 0.12</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.04	  vs 1.73</p>
<p>    Operating loss	  20.01	 vs 1.97</p>
